赶不上床垫报道的截止日期。

850
00:36:40.280 --> 00:36:41.640
He can throw that in.
他可以把那个加进去。

851
00:36:41.640 --> 00:36:46.820
Oscar does say to Ned that this type of pressure is giving him PTSD from an old boss.
奥斯卡确实对内德说过，这种压力让他想起了以前一个老板给他的创伤后应激障碍。

852
00:36:47.020 --> 00:36:48.200
Any guesses who that is?
有人猜那是谁吗？

853
00:36:48.340 --> 00:36:51.420
Did you see what's right behind Oscar over his shoulder?
你看到奥斯卡肩膀后面的那个东西了吗？

854
00:36:51.600 --> 00:36:51.920
Yes.
看到了。

855
00:36:51.920 --> 00:36:53.060
It's the Scarecrow.
是那个稻草人。

856
00:36:53.220 --> 00:36:53.580
I know.
我知道。

857
00:36:53.840 --> 00:36:55.580
The homemade Scarecrow doll that Michael Scott gave him.
那是迈克尔·斯科特送给他的自制稻草人玩偶。

858
00:36:55.680 --> 00:36:57.100
But I also caught something else.
但我还发现了另一个细节。

859
00:36:57.260 --> 00:37:00.600
It is a framed picture of Oscar's dog, Gus.
那是奥斯卡的狗狗古斯的装裱照片。

860
00:37:01.100 --> 00:37:02.220
Oh, his real dog.
哦，他真正的狗狗。

861
00:37:02.400 --> 00:37:02.760
Yes.
是的。

862
00:37:02.920 --> 00:37:04.680
So Gus was his dog while we filmed The Office.
所以我们在拍《办公室》时，古斯就是他的狗。

863
00:37:04.740 --> 00:37:06.100
Gus has since passed.
古斯后来去世了。

864
00:37:06.280 --> 00:37:11.560
But that picture of Gus in that frame was the same one that was on his desk in The Office.
但那个相框里的古斯照片，和当年他在《办公室》桌上摆的是同一张。

865
00:37:11.640 --> 00:37:15.880
And I actually reached out to Oscar and I was like, Oscar, am I losing it?
我其实还联系了奥斯卡，我说，奥斯卡，我是不是疯了？

866
00:37:15.960 --> 00:37:18.420
But I'm pretty sure that's Gus in the frame.
但我很确定相框里就是古斯。

867
00:37:18.420 --> 00:37:22.200
The same one you had when we filmed, you know, at the Dunder Mifflin set.
就是你当年在邓德米夫林片场拍戏时摆的那张。

868
00:37:22.360 --> 00:37:23.500
And he said, it is.
他说，是的。

869
00:37:24.200 --> 00:37:25.100
Isn't that nice?
是不是很棒？

870
00:37:25.260 --> 00:37:30.020
So there are two things there from Oscar's original desk that have made it into the paper.
所以现在报纸上出现了两样来自奥斯卡最初办公桌上的物件。

871
00:37:30.020 --> 00:37:31.000
I love that.
我太喜欢这个了。

872
00:37:31.240 --> 00:37:36.700
Well, now we're in the parking lot of the mattress store and Mare and Ned are discussing what are
好了，现在我们在床垫店的停车场里，梅尔和内德在讨论他们的

