人格面具是什么？

874
00:37:38.020 --> 00:37:42.920
Like, what kind of couple are we going to be as we shop for this mattress undercover?
比如，当我们以卧底身份来买这个床垫时，我们要成为什么样的一对情侣？

875
00:37:43.280 --> 00:37:45.480
I mean, this is totally mom detectives, lady.
我的意思是，这完全就是妈妈侦探啊，女士。

876
00:37:45.680 --> 00:37:50.420
When I watched this scene, it was cracking me up because it made me think of me and you
我看这场戏的时候笑死我了，因为它让我想起了我和你

877
00:37:50.420 --> 00:37:55.960
undercover trying to figure out what was the windowless building in my neighborhood.
以前当卧底，试图搞清楚我小区里那栋没有窗户的建筑是什么。

878
00:37:56.080 --> 00:37:56.700
Yeah.
对。

879
00:37:56.700 --> 00:38:01.180
