Not regular.
不普通。

883
00:38:07.760 --> 00:38:08.840
Uh, hetero.
呃，异性恋。

884
00:38:09.760 --> 00:38:10.520
Uh, sis.
呃，顺性别。

885
00:38:10.800 --> 00:38:11.500
I don't understand.
我不明白。

886
00:38:11.500 --> 00:38:12.000
What are you asking?
你在问什么？

887
00:38:12.020 --> 00:38:13.480
No, I just mean, are we bougie?
不，我的意思是，我们是暴发户那种有钱人吗？

888
00:38:13.680 --> 00:38:15.020
You know, or are we cheap?
你知道的，还是我们很抠门？

889
00:38:15.160 --> 00:38:16.280
Are we too online?
我们是网瘾很大吗？

890
00:38:16.640 --> 00:38:18.520
Are we not online at all in a way that's kind of weird?
还是我们完全不上网，甚至到了有点奇怪的地步？

891
00:38:18.640 --> 00:38:19.500
You know, do we have kids?
你知道的，我们有孩子吗？

892
00:38:19.720 --> 00:38:20.680
Do you want kids and I don't?
你想生孩子而我不想？

893
00:38:20.780 --> 00:38:21.520
And it's kind of tearing us apart.
而这正把我们的感情撕裂。

894
00:38:21.520 --> 00:38:25.400
If this is making you at all uncomfortable, we don't have to be a couple at all.
如果你觉得这让你有任何不舒服，我们完全可以不装成情侣。

895
00:38:25.400 --> 00:38:25.780
Well, what?
好吧，什么？

896
00:38:25.780 --> 00:38:26.080
All right?
行吧？

897
00:38:26.800 --> 00:38:29.440
We can just be brother and sister.
我们可以只当兄妹。

898
00:38:30.220 --> 00:38:31.920
We're buying a mattress together?
我们俩一起买床垫？

899
00:38:33.260 --> 00:38:36.880
Our mom gets debilitating bladder infections.
我妈经常得严重的膀胱炎。

900
00:38:37.840 --> 00:38:39.320
She's, she's incontinence.
她，她失禁了。

901
00:38:39.340 --> 00:38:39.760
Oh my God.
我的天啊。

902
00:38:39.860 --> 00:38:40.400
Oh my God.
我的天啊。

903
00:38:40.480 --> 00:38:41.140
We're just a couple.
我们只是普通情侣。

904
00:38:41.600 --> 00:38:41.800
Okay?
好吗？

905
00:38:42.700 --> 00:38:45.480
Keep the mom thing in your back pocket if everything goes wrong.
如果一切都搞砸了，就把妈妈这事当成杀手锏藏着。

906
00:38:45.960 --> 00:38:47.960
I am so sorry to hear about your mother.
听到你母亲去世的消息我很难过。

907
00:38:48.400 --> 00:38:48.900
Thanks.
谢谢。

908
00:38:49.040 --> 00:38:49.380
Thank you.
谢谢你。

909
00:38:49.580 --> 00:38:50.260
It's his mother.
那是他妈妈。

910
00:38:50.520 --> 00:38:51.560
We're actually married.
其实我们已经结婚了。

911
00:38:51.740 --> 00:38:52.660
I'm also her boss.
我还是她的老板。

912
00:38:52.660 --> 00:39:01.470
It cuts to them in the mattress store and he has already talked about this mother.
镜头切到他们去床垫店，而他已经聊起他妈妈了。

913
00:39:01.730 --> 00:39:03.510
She's like, keep it in your back pocket.
她说，把这事当成杀手锏藏着。

914
00:39:03.570 --> 00:39:05.350
And it's clearly what he led with.
而这明显就是他一开场聊的话题。

915
00:39:05.810 --> 00:39:09.030
Well, I have a fun thing from Clarissa in Austin, Texas.
好吧，我这有一条来自德克萨斯州奥斯汀的克丽萨的有趣留言。

916
00:39:09.510 --> 00:39:12.090
Ladies, this isn't a question, more of a comment.
女士们，这不是个问题，更像是个评论。

917
00:39:12.410 --> 00:39:16.670
When I was watching the scene with Mare and Ned before they go into the mattress store,
当我看到梅尔和内德在进床垫店之前的那个场景时，

918
00:39:16.870 --> 00:39:21.750
