this, like, sort of passion she wakes up with.
这种，呃，她醒来时自带的那种激情。

1129
00:47:39.920 --> 00:47:43.760
Like, I feel like if Biscuit could, like, get us to all gather around, she'd say something
比如，我觉得如果饼干能，比如，让我们所有人都聚在一起，她会说出

