00:47:48.640 --> 00:47:49.500
That's bullshit.
纯属放屁。

1134
00:47:49.500 --> 00:47:51.020
We're going to fucking go at him.
我们要他妈的冲上去找他算账。

1135
00:47:51.120 --> 00:47:54.120
We're going to—
我们要——

1136
